# Data Dictionary

| Field | Description | Source |
|---|---|---|
| Financial Year | Reporting year (FY2020–FY2024) | UAB Annual Report |
| Total Assets | Total assets at year-end | Statement of Financial Position |
| Shareholders' Equity | Total equity attributable to shareholders | Statement of Financial Position |
| Customer Deposits | Total deposits received from customers | Statement of Financial Position |
| Customer Loans | Loans and advances to customers | Statement of Financial Position |
| Operating Income | Total operating income for the financial year | Statement of Profit or Loss |
| Operating Expenses | Total operating expenses for the financial year | Statement of Profit or Loss |
| Profit Before Tax | Profit before taxation | Statement of Profit or Loss |
| Profit After Tax | Net profit after taxation | Statement of Profit or Loss |
| ROAA | Return on Average Assets; measures profitability relative to average assets | Financial Highlights |
| ROAE | Return on Average Equity; measures returns generated on shareholders' equity | Financial Highlights |
| Gross NPL Ratio | Percentage of loans classified as non-performing | Financial Highlights |
| Loan Loss Coverage Ratio | Provision coverage for non-performing loans | Financial Highlights |
| Liquidity Ratio | Regulatory liquidity ratio | Financial Highlights |